Package: wpur
Type: Package
Title: Measure and Decompose the Whole Picture of Unequal Representation
Version: 0.1.2
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1.0)
URL: https://github.com/N-Yukihiro/wpur, https://n-yukihiro.github.io/wpur/
BugReports: https://github.com/N-Yukihiro/wpur/issues
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "NAKAJIMA", "Yukihiro",
      email = "yukihiro@sfc.keio.ac.jp",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides tools to implement the unified approach proposed by
    Wada and Kamahara (2024) <doi:10.1007/s11127-024-01159-z> for measuring
    unequal representation. It decomposes the whole picture of unequal
    representation into four components using alpha-divergence:
    disproportionality, malapportionment, wasted votes, and intra-party
    unequal representation.
